{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-14_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-14","title":"苏醒，浮出梦乡","storyCode":"M8-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-14_beg.txt","sourceHash":"76e60cd19ba618dcf44a062659747540297682905f28f06cbfc5f83983e0f406","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"群体中的个体会在相互支持中迎接未来，孤独的个体只能独尝自由的孤寂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那些乌萨斯的混账的确混在感染者和雇佣兵队伍里！他们假装是整合运动，所有人都长点眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"除了刚才涂上漆的人，一个都别放过！哪怕是想往里面再走一步，都直接干掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些整合运动，也是被煽动被骗过来的吧？！一定要杀了他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题，你该留给过几分钟被他们干掉的你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard，敌人的火力很猛！那可不是整合运动该有的火力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"该有的火力是什么意思？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果给我们所有的炮手都配上新式兵器，我们大概能直接攻下切城，用不着靠天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经顾不得会不会露馅了，现在的他们就是拼了命地往里冲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么塔露拉没把他们放在身边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"因为她害怕！她害怕我们会识破这些人的身手，识破他们的诡计！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"人太多的话，恐怕她也没法盖得住了。而且，那些武器他们是没法直接拿在手上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那些武器怕是早就藏在核心城各个地方，就等这个最混乱的时候了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"他们一开始就是被设计来对付我们的！他们想要杀掉我们所有人。但他们错了！不是他们杀掉我们，是我们会杀掉他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"保持阵型！前进！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"做什么？！你们要......要离开阵地？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的，看清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就是战争的阵地！我们在哪里，阵线就在哪里！前进！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这样不行的，我们的队伍跟不上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会顶住，找机会做掉他们，你们就能跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"幻影弩手们，做得到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"没了队长，我们没什么优势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们可以做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德队长为了我们连命都可以不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果那个罗德岛的兔子真的可以为队长报仇，那我们的命也确实不算什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不用这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......罗德岛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"直接轰炸他们的阵地，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，收到信息的话，帮我干扰他们的通讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬间里让他们的耳机都爆炸就好了。啊，嗯，声音大一点，不是真的爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"当然把他们的耳朵炸掉也是可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，五秒是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"四秒，幻影弩手们，准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"三秒。Guard，让队伍散开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......我信你一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫，撤盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你会暴露！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"也没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，游击队兄弟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"一秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"肯把命托付给我们的人，我们的命，当然也由她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那些混在整合运动里的家伙突然倒下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"三把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Guard曾经思考过很多次这个问题。\n现在他又再一次问自己，罗德岛那些拥有奇异力量的干员们，那些能够主宰战场的干员们，自己究竟该怎么看待他们？\n后来，Ace给了他一个答案。Scout给了他一个答案。现在迷迭香，Rosmontis，也给了他一个答案。\n巨剑砸向了敌人的火炮，萨卡兹雇佣兵抬起手中巨弩，Guard不禁大喊出声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫，举盾！保护迷迭香！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们是一个小队。他们需要保护，需要协同，需要理解。\n他们是人。和自己一样奋战着的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃下！眼睛很尖，小兄弟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，Guard。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不客气。继续吧，迷迭香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫们，小队干员们，感染者们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，家人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们会回家。我们打赢他们，阿米娅打败塔露拉，然后我们回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduatecore"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在哪里？\n我该回去了。\n有一些冷......\n那些黑影是怎么回事呀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啊，想起来了，它们快要冻死了，所以我把什么分给了它们。\n唔，好冷。\n我把什么分给了它们？\n想不起来了。好像是很重要的东西。好像有人告诉我绝对不要把这东西交给别人。\n那我为什么......会给它们？\n是因为这东西不重要吗？应该不是吧。如果太冷的话，我也会消失的。\n......\n我知道了。\n是因为我的朋友们一定会这样做的。\n我的朋友......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有很严厉的人。他会把我当朋友吗？\n有会给我唱歌的人。我很久没听她唱歌了。\n有眼神很凶的人。但她做的东西很好吃。\n有我最重要的人。是她告诉我可以去哪里。但是......我不明白。我实在是不太明白。\n还有不说话的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有什么来了。\n好多黑色的影子。\n它们要做什么？\n它们也要我的生命吗？\n对，生命。\n生命是......重要的。\n是这样吗？\n生命这东西，有用吗？\n黑色的影子，离我好近。\n......它们是来夺走我的生命的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduatecore"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是......什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"退后一些，博士。别上前去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还是来晚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_20"},{"type":"narration","text":"那已经不是一个感染者了。\n那是另一种生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......悲惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这种案例即使是我，也只在过去见过一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"施术者与他的受害者连成一体，肉体与源石结成的山丘上开出易碎的花朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"粉末随风飘撒，任何途经那片遭诅咒之地的人都将因沾染粉尘而感染——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——并且，那个不幸遭害的人将成为新的宿主，去传播更多苦痛与死亡。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你似乎不只是在描述一件往事。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"任何修辞对这桩惨剧而言都是侮辱，我所说的字字属实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"感染源的活力如同毒药，它对生物的毒害不会自然停止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那时我暗下决心，绝不让这类事件重演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"然而事与愿违，我意识到，这些事情只会在我眼前一次又一次地发生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低吟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......它的意识似乎已经陷入了沉睡。它在无意识地宣泄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那些没有被它操控的牧群萨卡兹们，似乎也是因为它没有尝试去控制某个个体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很讽刺。牧群竟然会有自由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（哼鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，它就是源石粉尘大规模扩散的元凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。如果牧群萨卡兹最后也会向这个形态转化，损失将不可估量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它的粉尘已经不再是一种单纯的源石技艺。它甚至会感染普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"开满了数座城市的源石花，这种景象我不想再看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}。 我们要先制服它，停止牧群的扩大，阻止感染的传播。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它是......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识它？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不太清楚。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不清楚你在思考什么，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是审判者，Dr.{@nickname}。 我只是个医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地身患顽疾，如果没有人去医治它，它会产生什么样的后果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，生物有免疫系统，假使大地有，它也许能从病创中自我修复......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们并不能生存在一片更加贫瘠的土地上。它会因此衰弱，而我们会因此而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们面前的感染者......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"首先说好，哪怕一种恶疾在现下被人视作绝症，在一个医生眼里那也绝非等同死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“特效药还未面世，患者的生命依然受到严重的威胁”，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"医生绝不会承认——哪怕所有人都如此确信，医生也不会承认一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“这病无药可医。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这是借口。这也绝不是医生该使用的借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"无论受到怎么样的威胁，我的医学知识也不会用于与人道相违之处，而所有生命自诞生起，都有尊严。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"医治矿石病患者是我的天职，无论感染者被当成是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不会放弃任何一个生命，任何一个还可能被治愈的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但医生也绝不会否认，有一些措施是我们必须采取的，去阻止更多人受到疾病的侵袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者不能成为别人的工具，任何人都不能操控一个生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我什么都不做，它会成为一个目标、一种武器、一个借口，如果我们放任它的话，我们并不能向乌萨斯复仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"相反，乌萨斯的伤口会成为其他人的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能放任一种痛苦的挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有些疾病，并不只是普通的医护人员所能医治的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地向他们施加的一切，只会在某些时候被变本加厉地倾泻给其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——医生所能做的也就只有这么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想要去拯救更多生命......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就要做下决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"静谧。\n干员们戴着过滤系统，他们沉重的呼吸声清晰可闻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_33"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们的目标是确定无疑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我们要停止核心城的能源供给，在这之前，我们要解决数量不断上涨的牧群，杜绝另一场灾难的发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们的时间不多了。这种结局......甚至称不上是挽救。那些萨卡兹牧群的结局已经注定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希静静地站在那里，注视着已不能被再称作是感染者的白色结晶。\n你身上有多少疤痕？她问到。\n你并不知道她是在问那只颤抖不已的生物，还是在自问自答。\n白色的生物张开双臂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_20"},{"type":"narration","text":"你们想要什么？\n它想要向前挪行，脆弱的双翼却支不起它自己的身体。\n声音从它的喉咙里流泻出来，像是呜咽，汇成恐怖的河。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我感觉不太对。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的预感是正确的。那不是一个普通的感染生物，那是......这场大规模感染的起源。"}]},{"label":"真是......美丽的生物。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"非自然的生物，大多出自美学。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，别被外表欺骗，无论它有多美，它都是周遭这一切惨状的元凶。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它在唱歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
